(221, 190, 'directions', 'Hike 0.5 miles from the parking lot to the campground</br>\r\n• Five campsites, each with a picnic table and tent pad(s)</br>\r\n• Two vehicles per site allowed in the parking lot</br>\r\n• Campsite #5 has a horse hitch</br>', 'Hike 0.5 miles from the parking lot to the campground</br>\r\n• Five campsites, each with a picnic table and tent pad(s)</br>\r\n• Two vehicles per site allowed in the parking lot</br>\r\n• Campsite #5 has a horse hitch</br>\r\n<b>Camping is by Advance Permit Only</b> Required camping permits must be obtained online at www.jeffco.us/Open-Space at least 24 hours in advance.</br>', 'rhall290472', '2024-09-15 01:07:01');
